<<~ kanawai "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/ref/RFC-2119">>

<<~ ahu #/entry>>
! Identity carries capabilities; one helm carries their becoming

A pet-named location holds relations among entities. An entity MAY grow through
an intentionally narrow and composable sequence of CAD, polygon, attachment,
void and future geometric operators. Its pet-name follows witnessed relations,
not an OpenCascade face, a mesh vertex, or one compulsory geometry language.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/invariants>>
!! One OODA-HA authority

* ''One helm.'' All living capability epochs MUST enter the executable
  `run_ooda_epochs` phase controller. A second compound epoch scheduler MUST NOT
  independently decide lineages, invent previews or apply operator controls.
* ''Capabilities as child loops.'' Each actual candidate Act MAY open nested
  capability OODA-HA loops. Their trusted operators MUST execute in their own
  Acts; their effects and validation receipts MUST return before the parent
  leaves its phase. An inactive capability reports inactivity, not fabricated
  successful work.
* ''Per-entity composition, not global uniformity.'' A crystal MAY carry CAD,
  polymesh and a semantic socket; fortress MAY carry CAD and rooms; Joining MAY
  carry CAD contact with optional sculptural growth. An unrelated nameless
  entity MAY carry only a polygon operator. Operator versions and activation
  gates belong to the recipe.
* ''Lineage inherits methods.'' A selected lineage carries bounded CAD loci,
  surface loci, active operators, recipe digest, original evidence hashes and
  operator implementation fingerprints. An exported OBJ or STEP never replaces
  that generative ancestry.
* ''Kernel authority remains scoped.'' CAD gates certify exact structural
  contact, fused valid material and carved voids. Closed polymesh gates certify
  polygon surface/volume only. Semantic socket tests certify proximity, NEVER
  cross-kernel Boolean fusion or structural load-bearing capacity.
* ''The view budget constrains ornament.'' An unregistered artwork MAY guide
  limited, source-digest-checked visible surface displacement in a fixed camera
  while preserving protected CAD sockets. It MUST NOT infer true world scale,
  mechanical soundness, or unseen backsides.
* ''Do not consume exploration to preserve lineage.'' The inherited parent
  takes its own named proposal seat. Sobol, local and topology generators retain
  their independent trials; exact evaluation budgets may defer but not silently
  replace them.
* ''Operator choice remains real.'' Aftermath MUST present audited compound
  preview witnesses with entity `#has` propositions for pet-naming, o-takiage
  and choosing an alternate valid parent. Full-speed and manual steering run
  the same phase machine and mandatory gates.
* ''Aftermath births a reviewable gallery.'' A final location Aftermath MAY
  open its own full OODA-HA gallery loop. It evaluates the historical scored
  pool, retains meaningful slack, then regrows and audits each finalist. When
  fewer than three distinct forms survive, it reports the shortfall rather
  than duplicating models or manufacturing an image-fitness success.
* ''Evergreen in widening and tightening passes.'' Development Aftermath
  inspects method claims, code boundaries, then overall architectural fit;
  the ensuing tightening passes correct code, tests, documentation and CI.
  Runtime Aftermath records consequences of model growth, not development QA.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/executable>>
!! Active source

`tools/projection-loom/projection_loom/capability_stack.py` registers a
trusted, versioned DAG of capability operators; `hybrid.py` grows bounded
CAD-derived meshes and semantic sockets; `ooda.py` executes the single
recursive location/epoch/candidate/capability/gallery controller; `epochs.py`
provides the underlying strict CAD audition. The original Necrospire RGBA and
alpha, an under-specified visual witness, remain authoritative reference
bytes, not a calibrated survey.

Run with `python -m projection_loom ooda-run --project
examples/necrospire/project.json --capability-recipe
examples/necrospire/hybrid/recipe.json --control full-speed --passes 3
--candidates 4 --exact-budget 3 --detail-budget 3 --finalists 3
--out out/compound` from `tools/projection-loom/`.

<<~/ahu>>

